      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t how single quote escaping works.  A \\ inside the single quotes is a literal \\.  The escaping replaces a \u0027 with the sequence \u0027\\\u0027\u0027.  The first single quote ends the single quoting, the \\\u0027 concatenates a literal single quote, and the last single quote restarts the single quoting.\n\nSee https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/blueprint/proptools/escape.go;l\u003d88;drc\u003dcc1ec0fedc0e74183891973c327d21201734c585 for the exact escaping, you should be able to reverse it.",
